# SafeVault Security Project

## Overview
This project secures an application using input validation, authentication, and protection against vulnerabilities.

## Vulnerabilities Found
- SQL Injection
- Cross-Site Scripting (XSS)
- Weak input validation

## Fixes Applied
- Used parameterized queries
- Encoded user input
- Added validation rules

## Authentication
- Login system implemented
- Role-Based Access Control (Admin/User)

## Testing
- Tested input validation
- Tested SQL injection prevention
- Tested XSS protection

## Use of Copilot
Copilot helped generate secure code, suggest fixes, and improve debugging.
